# Security gate

Test only this project, localhost, or staging the owner approved in writing.

Pentester uses Strix + targeted cybersecurity skills. No exploit against third-party systems. No `fix-*` Strix skill. Findings → tickets to the owning builder with SHA.

Do not put secrets in chat, git, board, or bus.
